      "text": "A production task typically stores:\n\nTitle\nDescription\nStatus\nPriority\nAssignee\nReporter\nDue Date\nSprint\nLabels\nStory Points\nEstimated Time\nActual Time\nAttachments\nComments\nActivity History\nCreated By\nUpdated By\nCreated At\nUpdated At\n\nWe'll grow the model gradually rather than adding everything on Day 1.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
