      "text": "AI Workflow Builder",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AI Workflow Builder",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Zwa1Nd_Lp4x1-GUWug9RB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 812.9033528477696,
      "y": 10990.658171524046,
      "width": 1133,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1035013658,
      "version": 17,
      "versionNonce": 307204102,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785386431308,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Instead of hardcoding every automation, users can create workflows such as:\n\nNew document uploaded\n        │\n        ▼\nAI summarizes it\n        │\n        ▼\nCreate tasks automatically\n        │\n        ▼\nAssign to engineering team\n        │\n        ▼\nNotify Slack/Email\n\nThis introduces event-driven architecture, background processing, AI orchestration, and automation—all \nvaluable backend engineering concepts.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Instead of hardcoding every automation, users can create workflows such as:\n\nNew document uploaded\n        │\n        ▼\nAI summarizes it\n        │\n        ▼\nCreate tasks automatically\n        │\n        ▼\nAssign to engineering team\n        │\n        ▼\nNotify Slack/Email\n\nThis introduces event-driven architecture, background processing, AI orchestration, and automation—all \nvaluable backend engineering concepts.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
