      "text": "This is one you'll appreciate later because it shows AI as a service, not as a separate app.\n\n                  User asks AI\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                 Django API\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                 AI Service\n            ┌───────────┼────────────┐\n            │            │              │\n            ▼            ▼              ▼\n      Prompt Builder  RAG Search    LLM API\n            │            │              │\n            └───────────┴────────────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                AI Response Returned",
